# Never commit Mazda/JCI files: your own stock dumps live here
stock/*
!stock/README.md
# build output (contains patched Mazda templates) and harness roots (full stock GUI copies)
overlay/
harness/root-*/
harness/shots/
*.ttf
*.otf
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
# Privacy: audit reports, denylists and scanner pattern lists never go public
# (listing what you filter publishes it)
*SECURITY-AUDIT*
*audit-report*
*denylist*
RELEASE-CHECKLIST*
*.secret
secrets.conf
settings.conf
# raw captures / generated maps / photos with metadata
*.raw
*-map.html
*.jpg
*.jpeg
# own neutral placeholder photo (no brand logo) is needed for the build
!overlay-src/common/oemplusb2/images/B2EcoCarPhoto_B.jpg
harness/RESULTS*.json
